SPOILER:






























Easy way to uncurse lots of stuff:
1. Get a lot of potions, at least one with holy water.
2. Dip all your potions in water, exept from the holy one.
3. Make all your potions of water one inventory item, either by identifying them
   as uncursed, or by dropping them at an altar.  (If the altar is
   lawful, you will already have lots of potions of holy water.)
4. Dip ALL your potions of water in the one potion of holy water. Now all
   the potions are holy water, and may be used for uncursing.
Maybe not a very easy way, but at least you don't need a lawful altar. 

